{"channelId":"UC0ReGss0rTf5WhAvQpDCoEA","row":["West Park Animal Hospital",13,"Advanced veterinary care by qualified professionals is available at West Park Animal Hospital. Our American Animal Hospital Association-accredited facility in Cleveland, OH, comes fully equipped to deliver comprehensive veterinary services for cats and dogs, as well as other small companion animals. Whether your pet requires intensive care or surgery, or something less serious, such as dental or sight care, you will find our staff ready and willing to perform the necessary procedures to ensure your pet’s fullest recovery and wellbeing. For your convenience, we also offer after-hours emergency services until 1:00 a.m. Discover for yourself a new standard of care for your furriest family members by becoming a client at West Park Animal Hospital. Visit our facility at 4117 Rocky River Drive, Cleveland, OH 44135 or at wpahcle.com .","staff@westparkanimalhospital.com; staff@wpahcle.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0ReGss0rTf5WhAvQpDCoEA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0ReGss0rTf5WhAvQpDCoEA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:43.041Z","channelId":"UC0ReGss0rTf5WhAvQpDCoEA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"60283510ca3c015d4bec5f0f1fe5cd2cb36334650b625aab295a7e028652d2fb","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b677dcfb5dd1e3fd9348fa525a995af5f5d6de1803b8bc7b71bfbde056c13b47"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0ReGss0rTf5WhAvQpDCoEA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T07:59:59.714Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0ReGss0rTf5WhAvQpDCoEA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":13,"raw":"13 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0ReGss0rTf5WhAvQpDCoEA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:43.041Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"staff@westparkanimalhospital.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identit